{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act7d5_level_act7d5_st02",
  "groupId": "act7d5",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "日記本",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act7d5/level_act7d5_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "75ec544313859936eca6c89e1a55176102762e880a1c9772b71f4820095ff325",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "白面鴞，你回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "這次代替我實地考察辛苦了，在你離開的這段時間裡，我手上的這場實驗也接近完成了，之後我就可以自己去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "下次也可以讓我去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "發生了什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯，那麼，我先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "............好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我記得，應該是這本日記本......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不對，這本是還在萊茵生命時寫下的了。那麼，應該是這本......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "找到了，是這本，在跟隨赫默來到羅德島後，換的新日記本。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "讓我看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "3月21日 陰",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "今天，島上加入了兩個新的幹員，一個叫吽，一個叫阿，他們似乎是和槐琥小姐來自同一個地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "其中，令人在意的是阿，他看起來十分年輕，據說在龍門是非常有名的黑醫生，不過他似乎不會加入醫療部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "4月2日 多雲",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "......對了，自從阿發現華法琳就是“血先生”後，他就經常來醫療部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "但醫療部的大部分人都不喜歡他，因為他毫不掩飾地對身為同行的我們表現出厭惡感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "他明明醫術相當高明，這是為什麼呢？......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "4月15日 晴",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "......說到阿，在上次和華法琳比試的最後，吽過來把他帶走之後，他收斂了一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "而醫療組的各位已經逐漸習慣了他的性格——至少表面上如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "這麼說起來，寫下這篇日記的時候，正好是他和華法琳的第二次“對決”呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "喂，“血先生”，來比試吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "text": "哇，你這個小鬼好煩，上次輸給我你還沒意識到我們之間的差距嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "你認真的？那個能算我輸嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "喂，那邊的羽毛大姐，你當時也在場，你說說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "赫默，他在叫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "他在叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "根據系統判斷，雖然也有50%叫我的可能性，但我的邏輯思維判斷我不想回應這個稱呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我也不想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "你們在說什麼悄悄話呢，快說啊，上次那個怎麼也不算我輸吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "......阿，現在是工作時間，請你不要隨意來打擾我們工作好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "是是是，我只是問個問題，問完就走，絕不打擾你們高尚的“工作”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "好吧，調用系統記錄中......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "根據系統記錄顯示，確實，客觀來說，上次的比試，由於最後的突發狀況，很難判斷究竟是哪方的勝利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "嘿，聽到了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "text": "嘖，行吧，看我今天讓你輸得心服口服！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛聊天的醫療幹員",
      "text": "哎，自從這個阿來了之後，每天都雞飛狗跳的。真是不明白博士為什麼會把這樣的人招進來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "雖然性格很惡劣，但不可否認的是，他的臨床經驗以及天賦，確實十分驚人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛聊天的醫療幹員",
      "text": "你說的我也明白，但我覺得他根本就看不起我們欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的醫療幹員",
      "text": "對對，上次那場手術確實讓很多人對他刮目相看了，我本來也對他有些改觀，想和他搞好關係，結果被他一頓嘲諷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的醫療幹員",
      "text": "氣死我了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八卦的醫療幹員",
      "text": "也就只有華法琳大姐頭能跟他搞好關係了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的醫療幹員",
      "text": "他們那叫搞好關係嗎......白面鴞你覺得呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "從系統中檢索詞彙......檢索結果，臭味相投。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的醫療幹員",
      "text": "哈哈哈，沒錯，就是這個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "你們在聊什麼呢，這麼開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八卦的醫療幹員",
      "text": "啊，安賽爾醫生，我們在聊阿呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "噢......雖然我不是很擅長應付他那樣的性格，但確實是一個很厲害的新人呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活潑的醫療幹員",
      "text": "不愧是安賽爾醫生，即使對阿都這麼溫柔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "好了，就算今天沒有什麼事，工作時間也禁止閒談，回到你們的工作崗位去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員們",
      "text": "是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "安賽爾，怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "唔，這裡是報告，總的來說，效果不是很令人滿意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "嗯，雖然事先已經預想到了，那麼，馬上準備下一場實驗吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "白面鴞，你也一起去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "Zzzzzzz......嗯？好，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "阿的加入為醫療部帶來了一些吵鬧和波瀾，雖然其中有些不愉快，但不知為什麼，我並不討厭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯，我在這一篇寫了，“我並不討厭。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "如果我沒記錯的話，往前應該還有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "對了，在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "6月10日 小雨",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "根據偵查幹員的情報，在周邊的山區裡似乎發現了源石礦脈，凱爾希醫生已經派人去勘查了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "保險起見，赫默和一些醫療幹員也一起去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "今天除了等待實驗結果沒有別的事要做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "5月15日 晴",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "嘉維爾隨隊出外勤回來了，她在晚飯的時候給我們講了她因為覺得敵人竄來竄去很煩，所以親自上陣把他們全都收拾了一頓的光輝事蹟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "雖然她似乎忘了自己是一名醫療幹員，不過，聽起來是有些令人嚮往。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "5月1日 多雲",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "今天，在面試了新的醫療幹員後，和安賽爾聊起了來到羅德島之前在做什麼的話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "出於保密義務，我無法向他透露許多萊茵生命的內部情況，不過，這是一次相當有意義的對話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "對了，就是這次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "也就是說，你在萊茵生命的時候，也是一半患者一半研究者的身份嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "是的，從那時起直到現在，我都一直在接受赫默給我定製的醫療計畫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "並且赫默自身也是感染者，她也有專屬的醫療計畫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "在萊茵生命中這樣的事並不少見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "原來萊茵生命也有做和羅德島類似的事情啊，我一直以為萊茵生命是一家科技公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯，畢竟不是像羅德島這樣主動對外宣傳的做法，具體我無法多說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不過可以肯定的是，萊茵生命會和羅德島合作也是因為在這方面有共同的志向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "確實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "那說說我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "嗯......其實能說的也不多，我的家鄉在雷姆必拓，因為我家比較窮，所以我一直沒有什麼機會接觸很先端的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "四處碰壁之後，我偶然發現了羅德島的招募廣告，抱著試一試的態度投了一份簡歷，然後就來到這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "剛到這裡的時候我嚇了一跳呢，沒想到以後會是在這樣一個地方工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "確實，一開始聽赫默說要合作的時候，我也沒有想到羅德島會是一座小型陸上航母。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "不過來到這裡之後，我也確實學到了很多東西，而且待遇也很不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "雖然不能經常回家見不到家人有些遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "家人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "呃，難道我說了不該說的話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不，沒什麼，我只是在資料庫中回憶了一下我的家庭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "找到了，原來如此，我都有些忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "......見不到家人一定不好過吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "誒，不會嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "比起這個，繼續說你的事吧，安賽爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安賽爾",
      "text": "啊，嗯，對了，我給你說一說雷姆必拓吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "安賽爾說了許多他家鄉的事，礦業城市的風景，他的家庭，他的妹妹，他為什麼會選擇成為醫生等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "不知道為什麼，總覺得離我有些遙遠，就好像記憶中父母的樣貌一樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "是的，醫療部的各位也會在平時聊一些自己的事情，我對大家的過去並不陌生，但對我來說，總是一件十分遙遠的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不過，在此之前，我一直覺得這也是一件十分正常的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "但是，問題確實是存在的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "那麼，該寫下這一次的日記了，這一次，或許會寫得長一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "X月X日 陰",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "終於回到了羅德島，這一次的出行，花了不少時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "雖然過去也偶爾會跟隨小隊出行，但這次有一些額外的情況，也給我帶來了一些問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "是的，問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "Zzzzz......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......小姐，白面鴞小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......！我睡著了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "是的，我是來通知你的，我們的採集遇到了一點狀況，現在正在重新調試工具。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "需要我幫忙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "不不不，白面鴞小姐你已經幫了許多忙了，調試都是單純的體力活，怎麼好麻煩你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "我來是想告訴你，隊長說，調試工作今天之內可能沒法完成，你要是覺得無聊的話，不遠的地方有個卡西米爾村莊，你可以去那裡逛逛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "那裡是這一帶唯一的流動村莊，規模不小，而且偵查幹員說那裡正在舉辦集市，可以消磨時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "當然，如果你想在這裡繼續休息的話，也沒有問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......嗯，我想去看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "好的，那麼這裡是地圖，經費也已經準備好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "雖然有些不好意思，不過原本沒有考慮到這種情況，所以兌換的卡西米爾幣有限，只有這麼多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "卡西米爾幣，兌換？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "啊，嗯，雖然龍門幣在不少國家被承認，但畢竟不是萬能的，尤其是移動城邦外的村莊，通常只接受本國的貨幣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......嗯，確實應該是這樣，從資料庫中找到了同樣的情報。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "那麼，讓我們出發吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "咦，你也要去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "啊，不是，因為這是一次小型行動，我們是沒有在這裡架設臨時基站的，也就是說通訊設備沒有辦法使用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "所以缺少戰鬥力的人要外出的話，通常需要一個護衛的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "而且，大家都知道你的身體狀況，為了你的安全著想，肯定不能讓你一個人去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "原來如此，基站有關的情報我是第一次知道，需要更新資料庫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "咦，白面鴞小姐不知道嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不，我很少出門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "啊，確實，對不起，是我失言了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "為什麼你要道歉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "不，沒什麼，讓我們出發吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "現在回想起來，他會向我道歉，是因為他覺得自己沒考慮到我的身體狀況而說了可能會傷害我的話吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "事實上，我在當時完全沒有想到這一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "在這裡，我遇到了第一個問題——我似乎不知道很多理所當然的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不，確切地說，我不是不知道，這些都存在我的資料庫中，只是因為太久沒有使用，我忘記了自己知道的事實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯，這裡的修辭要修改一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "然後，是第二個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "卡西米爾的風景和哥倫比亞以及在羅德島上看到的艦橋風景都相差許多，空氣潔淨度很高，植被覆蓋率也很高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "村莊內大部分村民都是庫蘭塔，但也有一些其他種族的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "令人吃驚的是，村中集市比我想像的要熱鬧許多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "在和負責採購的後勤幹員會面後，他向我介紹了一下這裡，並詢問我要不要買些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我想，或許我可以給醫療部的各位帶些禮物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "小姐，你想要什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "喂，小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": ".......我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "啊？不是，你這人怎麼回事，要買東西又不知道買什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，我的同伴容易走神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "我們想要一些卡西米爾的土特產。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "在那個時候，我意識到了第二個問題，我不知道醫療部的各位喜歡什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "這並不意味著我們關係不好，相反，根據廣義上的定義來說，我和赫默醫生應當是好朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我們從萊茵生命時期就一起合作過很多次，也是她邀請我來到羅德島的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我和其他的醫療幹員，關係應該也不壞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "但我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我從來沒有想過這個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "在那之後，我們就回到了營地，實地考察也順利進行了下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "但是在返程的路上，我開始不可遏制地思考一些我從來沒有意識到的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯......當然，其實一半的時間都在睡覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "在前往村莊的路上，其實也站在路中間睡過去了一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不過，為了讀起來更順暢，這裡就省去好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "自從加入萊茵生命，轉而來到羅德島後......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "白面鴞姐姐，快開門！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "伊芙利特，你怎麼來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "赫默在做實驗，我聽說你回來了，就來看看你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "因為感覺白面鴞姐姐你平時都在，這次你出去感覺比赫默不在都不習慣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "你回來真是太好啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "確實，我很少出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......確實，我很少出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "為啥你要說兩遍一樣的話，白面鴞姐姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "沒什麼，我只是忽然想到，其實我並不經常出門這個事實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "啊？白面鴞姐姐你是不是出門把腦袋撞壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "並沒有，只是系統發生了一些未知錯誤而已，現在已經修復了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我買了一些卡西米爾的土特產，在那邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "真的嗎！我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "哇，這把木劍好酷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "嘿，哈，呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "你看，我像不像那些跳來跳去的庫蘭塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "誒......不管，反正我要這個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "故事書在書架上，你可以在那邊看，我要寫一些東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "呼......那麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "自從加入萊茵生命，轉而來到羅德島後，已經過了很長時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我已經完全習慣了現在的生活，並下意識地認為這是正常的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "但這次出行讓我意識到，不是這樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "並不是說我想否認現在的生活，我只是忽然意識到這樣一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "那就是，我其實已經離正常的生活很遠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "這裡應該用正常這個詞彙嗎，我的生活真的就是不正常的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......廣義上來說，應該確實是這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "而我只是忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "即使是我自己也很難描述，礦石病究竟從我身上奪走了什麼，又給了我什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "但至少，在萊茵生命時，赫默為我制定治療方案後，科研和睡眠就逐漸佔據了我的全部生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我的身體不允許我獨自完成耗時較長的工作，更不要說出門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我對這樣的自己有自知之明，所以就算偶爾的外出，我也很少自由行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "從很久以前開始，我所有對外界的認識就幾乎全部來自同事的描述、各種資料以及透過窗戶看到的一成不變的景色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "現在想來，我會嚮往嘉維爾和安賽爾也是很正常的事情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "但在今天之前，我其實並沒有意識到我為什麼會嚮往。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "因為在大家討論他們的生活時，我總是不由自主地把自己劃分在外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我可以參與他們的話題，但我下意識地認為我不屬於這些話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "白面鴞姐姐，你在寫什麼東西？看起來不像報告啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "日記。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "日記？哦，赫默讓我寫過，但我覺得太麻煩了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "確實，如果每天都要寫的話，是一個不小的工程，但對我是有必要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "為啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "為了不讓自己忘記。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "為啥會忘記？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "因為我容易忘記。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "嗯......不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "不要懂比較好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "喔......我能看嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "可以，不過都是文字，我想你不會喜歡的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "那算了，我回去繼續看故事書了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "對了，這麼說起來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "赫默，怎麼了，實驗遇上什麼問題了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "嗯？啊，不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "我只是在想，該給伊芙利特買些什麼禮物好，她的生日快要到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "生日禮物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "是啊，又要防火，又要讓她喜歡，唉，小孩子的心真是猜不透。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "乾脆我自己做一個好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "沒什麼，只是在想赫默你原來也會考慮這樣的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "很奇怪嗎？嗯......確實，有些不像我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "但我既然決定帶走伊芙利特，這就是我應當承擔的責任了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "即使是一頭紮進工作能好幾天不休息的赫默，也有這樣的一面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "其實我明白，這是我自己的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "或者說，這從一開始就不是一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我並不覺得自己悲慘，因為我並不討厭科研生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "相反，如果我討厭科研的話，從一開始就不會加入萊茵生命了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "無論是萊茵生命，還是羅德島，從經歷上比我悲慘的數不勝數，和他們相比，我是幸運的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "而且我相信，我在做的研究是有意義的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "所以，我寫下這些並不是為了哀歎，也不是想說，我忽然意識到自己過了一種錯誤的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我只是回想起了我寫日記的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我時而會聽到一些奇怪的聲音，金屬摩擦聲，撞擊聲，喊聲，爆炸聲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "這些聲音就好像來自我身體的深處，一直在困擾著我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "有時候從睡眠中醒來，我會有些恍惚，我會忘記我在哪裡，我在做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "當然，我並沒有真正忘記，但不可否認，我會需要比他人更多的時間和精力去回憶和記憶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "我會開始寫日記，就是為了避免忘記一些重要的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "重要的東西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "白面鴞姐姐，你看我幹嘛？而且從剛才開始你就在自言自語什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "沒什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "你該不會闖了禍想要讓我幫你給赫默說情吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "看在我們交情的份上，我可以幫你一次，但你別闖太大的禍啊，我才不想被赫默打屁股。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "呵呵，不用擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "今天的遭遇，只是讓我明白了一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "只是不去忘記，對於重要的東西來說，或許有些太少了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "日記",
      "text": "不，應該說，我希望自己能更瞭解我重視的人，我希望自己能做到更多的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我不希望自己會後悔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "白面鴞，伊芙利特是不是在你這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "啊，赫默來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "伊芙利特沒給你添麻煩吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "沒有，她很乖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "那就好，以及你沒事吧？今天看你回來的時候狀態有些不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "我沒事......不過，確實，我也剛想找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "找我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "是的，我想找你聊天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "text": "聊天？我們不是平時都會聊天嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "text": "嗯，我想，和你聊些我過去從沒想過的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
